WEBVTT

00:00:03.201 --> 00:00:07.698
Open Artificial Intelligence, Profiles, and click Add Profile.

00:00:07.698 --> 00:00:11.998
In the New AI Profile window, click Start on Blank profile.

00:00:11.998 --> 00:00:16.231
The other cards are ready-made profiles, including agents.

00:00:16.682 --> 00:00:20.040
Enter a Title, and set the Profile type to Agent.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:23.092
The Description and the Availability appear.

00:00:23.568 --> 00:00:26.431
Write the Description for the other assistants.

00:00:26.431 --> 00:00:29.995
It says exactly what the agent does and when to call it, and

00:00:29.995 --> 00:00:31.508
it is how they decide.

00:00:31.964 --> 00:00:35.390
Availability decides when the agent is included.

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:39.071
On demand includes it only when it fits the request.

00:00:39.071 --> 00:00:43.894
Always available includes it in every request, which uses more tokens.

00:00:44.349 --> 00:00:48.344
Under System instructions, tell the agent how to behave.

00:00:48.344 --> 00:00:49.439
Click Save.

